<item><title>Senegal wins right to host 2031 Francophonie Games</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-wins-right-to-host-2031-francophonie-games-ce1d7d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sn/senegal-wins-right-to-host-2031-francophonie-games-ce1d7d/</guid><category>Senegal</category><description>The Permanent Council of La Francophonie picked Senegal on 13 October 2026, a first for the country, after Dakar hosted the Youth Olympic Games.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:50:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" length="32606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
